---
interface Props { kind: string }
const { kind } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="notice demo" role="note">
  <strong>Demo {kind}</strong>
  These are illustrative profiles that show how the directory works. They are not real {kind === 'profile' ? 'members' : kind}, carry no verification, and are hidden from search engines. Verified member profiles will replace them. <a href="/media/why-profiles-are-labelled-demo/">Why?</a>
</div>
